<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>So Long</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">James Marriott</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">Are We There Yet?</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">12VXBO1La6gZ9XsizgBRPE</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:19.070" end="00:22.784">The whole town's been stood here in a line</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:22.784" end="00:25.717">The same shxt, for the sixteenth fxxking time</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:25.717" end="00:28.641">I'm not down, I'm just waiting for a sign</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:28.641" end="00:32.627">My brain sits, at the borderline</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:32.627" end="00:37.398" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(oh-oh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:37.398" end="00:38.898" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:37.662" end="00:40.852">It's all safe and swell for the lucky few</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:40.852" end="00:43.777">Who don't care, to take much note of you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:43.777" end="00:46.958">Clean my hands, with the lasting residue</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:46.958" end="00:51.743">A new place, in this decrepit field of view</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:51.743" end="00:59.743" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Oh-oh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:01.783" end="01:03.283" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:02.861" end="01:06.838">I don't wanna go!</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:06.838" end="01:12.692">Won't you say something to make this place my home?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:12.692" end="01:18.799">For now, I don't wanna go!</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:18.799" end="01:24.917">When there's nothing to do but pack my clothes</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:24.917" end="01:27.833">For now...</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:27.833" end="01:31.808">So long</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:31.808" end="01:34.996" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:34.996" end="01:37.917">It doesn't look like I'll be going further</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:37.917" end="01:40.844">I'll pick a hole, that I've festered in before!</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:40.844" end="01:43.769">A pit so dark that I can't observe her</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:43.769" end="01:48.808">I'll crawl so far that you won't hear me anymore</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:48.808" end="01:54.930" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Oh-oh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:54.930" end="01:59.729" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:59.729" end="02:03.964">I don't wanna go!</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:03.964" end="02:09.808">Won't you say something to make this place my home?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:09.808" end="02:15.924">For now, I don't wanna go!</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:15.924" end="02:21.773">When there's nothing to do but pack my clothes</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:21.773" end="02:24.961">For now...</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:24.961" end="02:26.461" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:25.714" end="02:28.894">The same woes with the same scars</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:28.894" end="02:31.820">The same tones at the same part</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:31.820" end="02:34.740">The same bones from the same heart</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:34.740" end="02:37.664">The same goes that he'll go far</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:37.664" end="02:40.853">The same girls at the same bars</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:40.853" end="02:43.521">The same walls and the same art</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:43.521" end="02:46.696">The same clothes in the same cars!</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:46.696" end="02:49.351">The same man but a new start!</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:49.351" end="02:55.194">I don't, I don't wanna go!</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:55.194" end="03:00.244">Won't you say something to make this place my home!</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:00.244" end="03:07.146">For now! I don't wanna go!</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:07.146" end="03:12.937">When there's nothing to do but pack my clothes!</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:12.937" end="03:15.851">For now...</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:15.851" end="03:19.851">So long</p></div></body></tt>